<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>The King's Hand, 2016</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;The assasination of Saudi Arabia's King &lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT: medium Arial; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;Muhammad bin Salman by Egyptian&amp;nbsp;special forces&amp;nbsp;draws the two countries with teetering relations into dire straits.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;A secret military plan known as "The King's Hand", an assault on an air base in Fayed and the home of the Egyptian military unit responsible for the assasination, comes into play. But some advisors worry that the plan is too little, too late as a military build-up by Cairo has been brewing for months. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT: medium Arial; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;Can you beat an advisary that has a&amp;nbsp;2 to 1 advantage in air superiority?&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
